": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0202203/P020220302/P020220302600830008554.doc", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202203/P020220302600830008554.doc"}], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202203/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1758555, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "2022年第1期", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/cxjsgl/202202/t20220218_1758555.htm", "content": "各县（市、区）人民政府，市直有关单位：\n为贯彻落实《福建省人民政府办公厅关于印发福建省农村生活污水提升治理五年行动计划（2021—2025年）的通知》（闽政办〔2021〕28号），打好农业农村环境污染攻坚战，持续改善", "docabstract": "农村生活污水提升治理", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/cxjsgl/202202/t20220218_1758555.htm", "docreltime": "2022.02.18 17:38:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于下达“十四五”农村生活污水提升治理任务的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明政办〔2022〕7号", "idxid": "SM00100-1300-2022-00028", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2022.02.15 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人民政府办公室", "recid": 1889352, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/cxjsgl/202202/t20220218_1758555.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "[原件]明政办〔2022〕7号（关于下达“十四五”农村生活污水提升治理任务的通知）.ofd", "appdocid": 1758555, "appfile": "P020220218636432888950.ofd", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/cxjsgl/202202/t20220218_1758555.htm", "fileext": "ofd", "_src": "/protect/P0202202/P020220218/P020220218636432888950.ofd", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/cxjsgl/202202/P020220218636432888950.ofd"}], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/cxjsgl/202202/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1758553, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "2022年第1期", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/202202/t20220218_1758553.htm", "content": "各县（市、区）人民政府，市直各单位：\n　　《三明市火灾事故调查处理规定》已经市政府研究同意，现印发给你们，请认真遵照执行。\n　　三明市人民政府办公室  \n　　2022年1月28日\n　　（此件